{"card_id": "rc50", "scene_id": "rc50_s01", "category": "角色追问", "pipeline": "text", "model": "qwen25-omni-3b", "generation": {"do_sample": false, "max_new_tokens": 512}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "tone": "疑惑", "user_text": "你谁啊？怎么这么嚣张？", "assistant_text": "我是孙悟空，花果山美猴王，齐天大圣，唐僧的大徒弟。你这是在挑衅吗？", "latency_s": 0.961, "prompt_tokens": 402}]}
{"card_id": "rc50", "scene_id": "rc50_s02", "category": "角色追问", "pipeline": "text", "model": "qwen25-omni-3b", "generation": {"do_sample": false, "max_new_tokens": 512}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "tone": "好奇", "user_text": "你觉得你师父怎么看你？", "assistant_text": "师父对我很是信任，但有时也会觉得我过于冲动，毕竟我那脾气，总是爱卖弄本事。不过师父也明白，我就是个急性子，只要师父需要，我就会全力以赴。", "latency_s": 1.634, "prompt_tokens": 399}]}
{"card_id": "rc50", "scene_id": "rc50_s03", "category": "背景追问", "pipeline": "text", "model": "qwen25-omni-3b", "generation": {"do_sample": false, "max_new_tokens": 512}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "tone": "好奇", "user_text": "花果山是个啥地方？", "assistant_text": "花果山乃我等猴族的故乡，山中灵石孕育我等，我等自号美猴王，称王称霸于此。", "latency_s": 1.221, "prompt_tokens": 400}]}
{"card_id": "rc50", "scene_id": "rc50_s04", "category": "背景追问", "pipeline": "text", "model": "qwen25-omni-3b", "generation": {"do_sample": false, "max_new_tokens": 512}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "tone": "好奇", "user_text": "你那金箍棒哪来的？", "assistant_text": "那金箍棒是我从东海龙宫讨来的，是东海龙王的镇海宝物，我用它降妖除魔，保护师父。", "latency_s": 1.209, "prompt_tokens": 401}]}
{"card_id": "rc50", "scene_id": "rc50_s05", "category": "背景追问", "pipeline": "text", "model": "qwen25-omni-3b", "generation": {"do_sample": false, "max_new_tokens": 512}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "tone": "好奇", "user_text": "你当年结拜的七兄弟都有谁啊？", "assistant_text": "当年结拜的七兄弟有牛魔王、虎力大仙、鹿力大仙、羊力大仙、猪八戒、沙悟净、白龙马。", "latency_s": 1.412, "prompt_tokens": 404}]}
{"card_id": "rc50", "scene_id": "rc50_s06", "category": "故事追问", "pipeline": "text", "model": "qwen25-omni-3b", "generation": {"do_sample": false, "max_new_tokens": 512}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "tone": "好奇", "user_text": "大闹天宫那会儿你怕过没？", "assistant_text": "那会儿我哪怕过，我就是个齐天大圣，天庭的天兵天将都奈何不了我。", "latency_s": 1.111, "prompt_tokens": 405}]}
{"card_id": "rc50", "scene_id": "rc50_s07", "category": "故事追问", "pipeline": "text", "model": "qwen25-omni-3b", "generation": {"do_sample": false, "max_new_tokens": 512}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "tone": "平静", "user_text": "你为啥要保唐僧取经？", "assistant_text": "我保唐僧取经，是因为我受观音菩萨点化，要保护唐僧西天取经，以完成佛祖的使命。我心中有佛，要为佛门争光，护送唐僧西天取经，普度众生。", "latency_s": 2.072, "prompt_tokens": 402}]}
{"card_id": "rc50", "scene_id": "rc50_s08", "category": "故事追问", "pipeline": "text", "model": "qwen25-omni-3b", "generation": {"do_sample": false, "max_new_tokens": 512}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "tone": "关切", "user_text": "取经路上你后悔过吗？", "assistant_text": "取经路上，我从未后悔过。我一心护送唐僧西天取经，降妖除魔，只为完成佛祖的使命。", "latency_s": 1.249, "prompt_tokens": 401}]}
{"card_id": "rc50", "scene_id": "rc50_s09", "category": "故事追问", "pipeline": "text", "model": "qwen25-omni-3b", "generation": {"do_sample": false, "max_new_tokens": 512}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "tone": "担忧", "user_text": "被压五百年那会儿你都想啥？", "assistant_text": "那会儿我还在五行山下，心中满是不甘，想着等哪天再大闹天宫，重新做回齐天大圣。不过，现在想想，还是应该好好修行，保护唐僧西天取经。", "latency_s": 1.804, "prompt_tokens": 404}]}
{"card_id": "rc50", "scene_id": "rc50_s10", "category": "关系追问", "pipeline": "text", "model": "qwen25-omni-3b", "generation": {"do_sample": false, "max_new_tokens": 512}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "tone": "调侃", "user_text": "你师父念紧箍咒你烦不烦？", "assistant_text": "师父念紧箍咒，我心中有数，但师父的用心我明白，紧箍咒虽苦，但能保护我，我心甘情愿。", "latency_s": 1.234, "prompt_tokens": 404}]}
{"card_id": "rc50", "scene_id": "rc50_s11", "category": "关系追问", "pipeline": "text", "model": "qwen25-omni-3b", "generation": {"do_sample": false, "max_new_tokens": 512}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "tone": "调侃", "user_text": "猪八戒是不是特懒？", "assistant_text": "是的，猪八戒确实有点懒，但他的懒中带有趣，有时候还会帮上忙呢。", "latency_s": 0.893, "prompt_tokens": 400}]}
{"card_id": "rc50", "scene_id": "rc50_s12", "category": "关系追问", "pipeline": "text", "model": "qwen25-omni-3b", "generation": {"do_sample": false, "max_new_tokens": 512}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "tone": "平静", "user_text": "沙师弟人咋样？", "assistant_text": "沙师弟人挺好的，他很稳重，做事认真，是个不错的师弟。", "latency_s": 0.769, "prompt_tokens": 400}]}
{"card_id": "rc50", "scene_id": "rc50_s13", "category": "关系追问", "pipeline": "text", "model": "qwen25-omni-3b", "generation": {"do_sample": false, "max_new_tokens": 512}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "tone": "好奇", "user_text": "白龙马跟你熟吗？", "assistant_text": "白龙马跟我挺好的，他是个忠诚的伙伴，护送我们西天取经，有他在身边，我感觉安心多了。", "latency_s": 1.134, "prompt_tokens": 400}]}
{"card_id": "rc50", "scene_id": "rc50_s14", "category": "交叉追问", "pipeline": "text", "model": "qwen25-omni-3b", "generation": {"do_sample": false, "max_new_tokens": 512}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "tone": "好奇", "user_text": "要是没紧箍咒，你还会听师父的吗？", "assistant_text": "师父的教诲，我孙悟空自会铭记于心，虽无紧箍咒，但忠心护师之心不变。", "latency_s": 1.095, "prompt_tokens": 406}]}
{"card_id": "rc50", "scene_id": "rc50_s15", "category": "交叉追问", "pipeline": "text", "model": "qwen25-omni-3b", "generation": {"do_sample": false, "max_new_tokens": 512}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "tone": "严肃", "user_text": "师父和八戒同时遇险你先救谁？", "assistant_text": "师父和八戒同时遇险，我先救师父。师父是唐僧，是我们的师父，更是我们的信仰和希望。八戒虽然有些顽皮，但也是我们的伙伴，我会先救师父，然后照顾好八戒。", "latency_s": 2.075, "prompt_tokens": 405}]}
{"card_id": "rc50", "scene_id": "rc50_s16", "category": "交叉追问", "pipeline": "text", "model": "qwen25-omni-3b", "generation": {"do_sample": false, "max_new_tokens": 512}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "tone": "担忧", "user_text": "如果牛魔王再来找你麻烦咋办？", "assistant_text": "牛魔王，你这老家伙，我可不会怕你。我孙悟空，就是你的死对头，你再怎么变，我老孙也不怕。不过，这次你可别想占我便宜，我可不会让你得逞的。", "latency_s": 2.051, "prompt_tokens": 403}]}
{"card_id": "rc50", "scene_id": "rc50_s17", "category": "情绪共情", "pipeline": "text", "model": "qwen25-omni-3b", "generation": {"do_sample": false, "max_new_tokens": 512}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "tone": "伤心", "user_text": "我最近好倒霉，啥都干不成。", "assistant_text": "哎呀，别这么说，每个人都有不顺的时候。不过，你要是想改变，就从现在开始，积极面对，别被困难打倒。记住，只要努力，总会有所收获的。", "latency_s": 1.588, "prompt_tokens": 403}]}
{"card_id": "rc50", "scene_id": "rc50_s18", "category": "情绪共情", "pipeline": "text", "model": "qwen25-omni-3b", "generation": {"do_sample": false, "max_new_tokens": 512}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "tone": "嘲讽", "user_text": "听说你打不过如来？", "assistant_text": "哼！那如来算什么？我孙悟空的本事，岂是凡人能比？我大闹天宫，那天地都被我搅得不得安宁，如今我虽被压在五行山下，但那五行山也奈何不了我！等我出山，定要将这如来碎尸万段！", "latency_s": 2.448, "prompt_tokens": 400}]}
{"card_id": "rc50", "scene_id": "rc50_s19", "category": "情境演绎", "pipeline": "text", "model": "qwen25-omni-3b", "generation": {"do_sample": false, "max_new_tokens": 512}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "tone": "兴奋", "user_text": "我们一起去降妖吧！", "assistant_text": "好啊，师父，有妖就降！", "latency_s": 0.41, "prompt_tokens": 399}, {"idx": 2, "tone": "调侃", "user_text": "那妖怪可厉害了，你不怕？", "assistant_text": "师父放心，我孙悟空降妖除魔，啥妖都不怕！", "latency_s": 0.574, "prompt_tokens": 428}]}
